  "kind": "jensen_window_pf_newman_polymath15_first_order_centered_prime_power_heat_starlikeness_length_propagation_gate",
  "proof_boundary": "This gate proves the exact append-one identity, J_0>1/20 and J_ray>49/1000 for the dyadic M=9 family, and J_0>1/20 and J_ray>49/1000 for every complete p>=5 chain of every length M>=2. It does not prove p=2,M>=10, p=3,M>=5, short or singleton chains, p-free or endpoint joins, a Xi Abel gap, a successor winding bound, Lambda<=0, PF-infinity, or RH.",
